      "extract": "\\label{RMT} We have just shown our lattice gauge theory data for the spectrum of the Dirac operator below, around, and above $T_c$, and compared it with some of the analytical formulas of Random Matrix Theory in the limit where the size of these matrices $N$ goes to infinity. It is of interest to see how a simple {\\em model} of a chiral phase transition in Random Matrix Theory behaves at finite $N$, as some external",
