      "extract": "The purpose of this study has been to find the extent to which Random Matrix Theory may be able to describe low-lying eigenvalue distributions and correlations between low-lying eigenvalues of the staggered Dirac operator at finite temperature. We have also been interested in testing the quenched theory with staggered fermions in the light of recent results with overlap fermions \\cite{EHKN_fT}, which indicated that",
